ALVA — Permanently Remove the Transform Button and Entire Transform System

Objective

Completely and permanently remove the Transform button, action, and all associated functionality from the Alva game.

Transform will never be used in Alva. It is not a planned feature, a reserved ability, or a future mechanic.

This is a permanent feature deletion, not a temporary UI change.

Do not merely hide or disable the button. Remove its underlying implementation and all unnecessary references throughout the codebase.

The finished game must behave as though Transform was never included in its control architecture.

