This applies to both touch-control schemes:

1. Joystick.
2. Classic Buttons.

The deletion must apply consistently in Quick Battle, Practice Ground, Watch Mode where relevant, and any other screen using the shared touch controls.

Do not replace Transform with an invisible button, dummy entry, or placeholder.

